{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 0, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2025-06-18", "capabilities": {"tools": {"listChanged": false}, "resources": {}, "prompts": {}}, "serverInfo": {"name": "ucas", "title": "ucas, a computer algebra system for programmers", "version": "1"}, "instructions": "ucas analyses functions (exhaustively on machine types), does exact algebra and calculus, transforms, number theory and finite fields, and finds cheaper implementations, each answer checked or proved.  Expressions are ucas syntax strings; give parameters types (x: u8, x: f32, x: real) where it matters.  Definitions persist across calls.  An ambiguous input is an error listing its readings: retry with args.assume.KEY.  structuredContent holds the typed result, checks and proof."}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(x)+cos(x)\n  sum to product: sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...\n    = sqrt(2)*sin(x + pi/4)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  amplitude-phase: a sin u + b cos u = R cos(u - psi), psi = atan2(a, b)\n    = sqrt(2)*cos(x - pi/4)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): sin u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(2i), cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2\n    = (exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(2*i) + (exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n  simplest: sin(x)+cos(x)  (as given)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "trig", "ucas": "trig sin(x)+cos(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "trig", "input": "sin(x)+cos(x)", "forms": [{"label": "sum to product", "identity": "sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...", "result": "sqrt(2)*sin(x + pi/4)", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}, {"label": "amplitude-phase", "identity": "a sin u + b cos u = R cos(u - psi), psi = atan2(a, b)", "result": "sqrt(2)*cos(x - pi/4)", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}, {"label": "exponential (Euler)", "identity": "sin u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(2i), cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2", "result": "(exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(2*i) + (exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}], "simplest": "sin(x)+cos(x)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "x is taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.220446049250313e-16, "passed": true}, {"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.220446049250313e-16, "passed": true}, {"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(x)+cos(x)\n  sum to product: sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...\n    = sqrt(2)*sin(x + pi/4)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  amplitude-phase: a sin u + b cos u = R cos(u - psi), psi = atan2(a, b)\n    = sqrt(2)*cos(x - pi/4)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): sin u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(2i), cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2\n    = (exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(2*i) + (exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n  simplest: sin(x)+cos(x)  (as given)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(x)^2+cos(x)^2\n  simplified: sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u\n    = 1\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  simplest: 1  (simplified)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 2, "ok": true, "cmd": "trig", "ucas": "trig sin(x)^2+cos(x)^2", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "trig", "input": "sin(x)^2+cos(x)^2", "forms": [{"label": "simplified", "identity": "sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u", "result": "1", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}], "simplest": "1"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "x is taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.220446049250313e-16, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(x)^2+cos(x)^2\n  simplified: sin^2 + cos^2 = 1, cosh^2 - sinh^2 = 1, f(f^-1(u)) = u\n    = 1\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  simplest: 1  (simplified)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of tan(x)\n  in sin and cos: tan = sin/cos, sec = 1/cos, csc = 1/sin, cot = cos/sin, tanh = sinh/cosh\n    = sin(x)/cos(x)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): tan u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(i(e^(iu) + e^(-iu)))\n    = (exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(i*(exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x)))\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  simplest: tan(x)  (as given)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 3, "ok": true, "cmd": "trig", "ucas": "trig tan(x)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "trig", "input": "tan(x)", "forms": [{"label": "in sin and cos", "identity": "tan = sin/cos, sec = 1/cos, csc = 1/sin, cot = cos/sin, tanh = sinh/cosh", "result": "sin(x)/cos(x)", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}, {"label": "exponential (Euler)", "identity": "tan u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(i(e^(iu) + e^(-iu)))", "result": "(exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(i*(exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x)))", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}], "simplest": "tan(x)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "x is taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.2063937537881762e-16, "passed": true}, {"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.2063937537881762e-16, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of tan(x)\n  in sin and cos: tan = sin/cos, sec = 1/cos, csc = 1/sin, cot = cos/sin, tanh = sinh/cosh\n    = sin(x)/cos(x)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): tan u = (e^(iu) - e^(-iu))/(i(e^(iu) + e^(-iu)))\n    = (exp(i*x) - exp(-i*x))/(i*(exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x)))\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  simplest: tan(x)  (as given)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(2*x)\n  compound and multiple angles: sin(a + b) = sin a cos b + cos a sin b, cos(a + b) = cos a cos b - sin a sin b\n    = 2sin(x)*cos(x)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-16)\n  simplest: sin(2*x)  (as given)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 4, "ok": true, "cmd": "trig", "ucas": "trig sin(2*x) expand", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "trig", "input": "sin(2*x)", "forms": [{"label": "compound and multiple angles", "identity": "sin(a + b) = sin a cos b + cos a sin b, cos(a + b) = cos a cos b - sin a sin b", "result": "2sin(x)*cos(x)", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}], "simplest": "sin(2*x)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "x is taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 1.1102230246251565e-16, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: x is taken as real\ntrig forms of sin(2*x)\n  compound and multiple angles: sin(a + b) = sin a cos b + cos a sin b, cos(a + b) = cos a cos b - sin a sin b\n    = 2sin(x)*cos(x)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 1e-16)\n  simplest: sin(2*x)  (as given)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  note: x, y are taken as real\ntrig forms of cos(x)-cos(y)\n  sum to product: sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...\n    = -2sin((x - y)/2)*sin((x + y)/2)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2\n    = (exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2 - (exp(i*y) + exp(-i*y))/2\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n  simplest: cos(x)-cos(y)  (as given)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "trig", "ucas": "trig cos(x)-cos(y)", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "trig", "input": "cos(x)-cos(y)", "forms": [{"label": "sum to product", "identity": "sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...", "result": "-2sin((x - y)/2)*sin((x + y)/2)", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}, {"label": "exponential (Euler)", "identity": "cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2", "result": "(exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2 - (exp(i*y) + exp(-i*y))/2", "checked": true, "check_points": 64}], "simplest": "cos(x)-cos(y)"}, "notes": [{"kind": "rule", "text": "x, y are taken as real"}], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 2.220446049250313e-16, "passed": true}, {"kind": "sample_points", "points": 64, "max_diff": 0, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  note: x, y are taken as real\ntrig forms of cos(x)-cos(y)\n  sum to product: sin a + sin b = 2 sin((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2), cos a + cos b = 2 cos((a + b)/2) cos((a - b)/2) ...\n    = -2sin((x - y)/2)*sin((x + y)/2)\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points (max relative difference 2e-16)\n  exponential (Euler): cos u = (e^(iu) + e^(-iu))/2\n    = (exp(i*x) + exp(-i*x))/2 - (exp(i*y) + exp(-i*y))/2\n    check: equal at 64 of 64 sample points\n  simplest: cos(x)-cos(y)  (as given)\n"}, "isError": false}}
